/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (      This system is focused on creating a structured, object-oriented property recommendation environment where different categories of properties are organized using hierarchical Java classes. It aims to demonstrate how Object-Oriented Programming \(OOP\) principles can be applied to design an application that securely handles property details, displays relevant data to users, and maintains modularity for future expansion. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10 11]
>>
endobj
