/E (   The project emphasizes reusable components through encapsulation and class-level separation, while method overriding and abstraction enable category-specific behaviors. Although the system currently operates through a console interface without external databases or real-time market integration, its architecture is intentionally built to support future enhancements, including advanced filters, user preference learning, and extended data management capabilities.)
/Pg 14 0 R
>>
endobj
