427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (    The proposed Property Recommendation System implements an object-oriented architecture designed to organize, categorize, and recommend properties based on predefined attributes and user-selected preferences. The system focuses on producing a structured and modular approach to property management using inheritance, encapsulation, abstraction, and polymorphism. Instead of relying on traditional, filter-only listing methods, this system emphasizes clear class separation, property categorization, and dynamic display of information. This chapter provides a detailed explanation of the system design, its architecture, component-level structure, and the underlying mechanisms that enable efficient property recommendation.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
