<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (         User interaction occurs through a menu-driven console application that enables browsing property types, viewing property details, and receiving basic recommendations. The system maintains a collection of predefined property objects stored in memory using Java Collections. These objects are processed and displayed according to user input. Polymorphism allows each property category to override display and detail-presentation methods, ensuring that the information shown is category-appropriate.)
/Pg 19 0 R
>>
endobj
